cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pi-Agent in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Pi-Agent: A Literature-Driven Autonomous Discovery Agent for Materials Science"
abstract: >-
  Pi-Agent is an LLM-centered agent that autonomously runs a complete
  literature-driven scientific discovery loop: literature search, knowledge
  extraction, research-gap identification, structure-property hypothesis
  generation, Bayesian/MCTS search, external database validation, and report
  generation. The public case study targets MOF materials for CO2 capture and
  ships with an auditable four-layer evidence chain and reproducible outputs.
authors:
  - name: "Pi-Agent Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alwayshere-su/pi-agent"
url: "https://github.com/Alwayshere-su/pi-agent"
license: MIT
version: 2.3.4
date-released: 2026-10-20
keywords:
  - llm-agent
  - scientific-discovery
  - materials-science
  - literature-mining
  - bayesian-optimization
  - mcts
